plugin-hostd (0.15.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * jack test: param_info of the passthrough fake is answered from
    clap.params, and the test build needs omx-clap-host-tests 0.25
  * tools/zynthian: the matrix measures omx-clap-host too, CLAP and LV2
    through its adapter
  * docs: the Zynthian status page names the current releases, without the
    fuzzing table
  * Zynthian chain round trip: a member run alone that left no peak is played
    again (#306)
  * Keep the preset_show reply test off docs/ and data/ so the installed
    smoke run has what it reads (#151)
  * Declare one reply shape for preset_show: resp 0 <json> (#151)
  * Release 0.15.2 (#142)
  * describe: pprops:logarithmic wins over lv2:integer's stepped in either
    order (#142)

